OL,3,GNEWSABaby P's mum given open prison
OL,4,Arecommendation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of the toddler known as Baby
OL,7,FP - who died after months of abuse -
OL,8,Fhas been told she will not be freed
OL,9,Ffrom jail, although the Parole Board
OL,10,Fhas recommended she should be moved to
OL,11,Fan open prison.
OL,13,FTracey Connelly was jailed in 2009 for
OL,14,Fcausing or allowing the death of her
OL,15,F17-month-old son Peter at their home in
OL,16,FTottenham, north London, in August
OL,17,F2007.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
