OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABaby P's mum given open prison
OL,4,Arecommendation
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was first released on licence in
OL,7,F2013 and has been in and out of prison
OL,8,Fsince then for breaching her parole
OL,9,Fconditions. Her most recent recall to
OL,10,Fjail was in 2024.
OL,12,FPublic parole hearings took place last
OL,13,FOctober, but the case was adjourned
OL,14,Fafter the panel decided there needed to
OL,15,Fbe a further psychological assessment.
